The problem you have is very common with the TK70. Your tape is stuck, you
have to remove the tape drive from the system. First shut your system down
and power off. After removing the tape drive you will see a solenoid on the
right side of the drive, push on the solenoid and then lift up on the 
release handle. You may now remove your tape. The tape leader is a black
piece of mylar plastic that runs from the takeup reel, over the head and 
then latches to a spring loaded plastic arm. What normally happens is this
tape leader breaks, or just doesn't latch back on the black plastic arm.
If the leader is broke you will have to get 1 from DEC. When relatching 
the leader make sure the end of the leader sticks out towards the tape.
If your not careful when latching the leader to the arm it will get caught
behind some other parts. and will not catch the tape when loading.

GOOD LUCK !
