However, you can use

$ EXCH/NET/TR=BLOCK/FDL=BACKUP.FDL infile.sav outfile.sav

To coconvert the file (assuming you have the diskspace and the appropriate
FDL file).  The FDL file would have contents like:

FILE
        ORGANIZATION            sequential

RECORD
        BLOCK_SPAN              yes
        CARRIAGE_CONTROL        none
        FORMAT                  fixed
        SIZE                    32256

