quotation. The purchasing dept, often has to put this out to competitive
tender, and often just sends out the list of part numbers quoted. A VAR (who
can often be a very small operation), just takes the price he gets from the
computer company and adds 1%.

This situation cannot really continue. All Computer Companies have to think
about using channels more and more. How they do that, whilst remaining
profitable is a difficult one.

All of these comments are my own beliefs, and are not necessarily held by
the company I work for.

