Try the following:
 
mc latcp
 
OR
 
mcr latcp
 
Also, look in SYS$MANAGER for LAT$SYSTARTUP.COM or LAT$SYSTARTUP.TEMPLATE.
Some older systems might also have a LTLOAD.COM floating around that does
the same thing as LAT$SYSTARTUP.COM .
 
