On DEC OSF/1 you can use 'scu' to change this. 
So: scu -f /dev/rrz#c

scu> change pages

find something like:

Changing DEC Specific Parameters (Page 25 - current values):

Spin-up Disable [R:0-1 D:0]: 

>Eric Anderson

I suppose there is also a jumper, but I don't have the rz28 docs
here.

