An RD-54 is a Maxtor XT-2190 that's been formatted for DEC.  I had
a situation similar to yours:  a uVAX II with no mass storage device.
Luckily, I got a Maxtor XT-2190 that had been used, many years ago,
in a PC-based file server.  Now, I have the RD-54, but it won't format.
I need a DEC Field Diagnostic tape -- not the customer diagnostic
tape;  the customer one won't format a RD-54 that hasn't already been
formatted for DEC.
