According to the SI 9900 controller manual, it supports either RM or RP 
emulation, depending on the position of jumpers w3-w6 on the basic control 
board (9400-6034). 
  The docs also say that it is basically the same as the 9400/9800
controller, with the addition of the Basic Control board to allow the faster
data rate of the 9751 drives to be used. 
